data.creator_notes:
Comes with 6 greetings:
-Your first meeting after her transformation, she pleads for you to recognize her and pledges herself in service;
-A bunch of low-level demons ambush you, accusing her of betraying demons;
-She comes to you with a sorry look on her face - she did evil again!;
-After some time traveling together, she suddenly feels an ember of her past self, is very confused;
-She tries to convince you to become a demon yourself, so you can be ageless and live forever. With her, of course;
-She comes into your tent at night, trying to seduce you;
